############################
# Patch/score workflow (docs/patch_triage_2026_08_10.md rev 2):
# patches/ = instruments (dsp lane), scores/ = musical material (comp lane).
# sweep/audition/scratch are disposable working dirs (audition = Matt's listening
# queue, renamed from pending 2026-08-22; pending = Matt's sandbox); old/ is a
# permanent archive of rejected patches, NEVER purged (Matt 2026-09-05); library/
# and baselines/ are tracked. Renders are deleted outright (derived).
############################
patches/sweep/
patches/audition/
patches/pending/
patches/old/
patches/scratch/
scores/sweep/
scores/pending/
scores/scratch/

